{"521180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slip Angle", "steam_appid": 521180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5108050], "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle is coming soon! Early Access is a chance for players to give feedback to the developer and have your voice heard leading up to the release of the game. Wishlist the game to get notified once available!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle pure arcade drift racing through diverse environments in a great selection of cars across multiple modes. Take yourself back to an era when games respected your time with easy pick-up-and-play ability while retaining a deep progression and challenges to keep you entertained for hours. We know we miss the days when racing games were about the driving feel and experience instead of all the unrelated, scripted spectacles trying to force-feed dopamine down our throats, and that's why we're making Slip Angle.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle is an arcade drift racer that is easy to learn and hard to master, putting you up against a series of challenges to unlock new tracks and cars that can be played across multiple modes. Slip Angle's physics and gameplay were built from scratch with a total focus on fun drift physics that feel amazing and are grounded in realism while still being accessible and unique. Slide your way through multiple variations of stunning tracks, challenging yourself with a diverse set of modes in cars that each have their own characteristics and driving feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/f8bb0e84f1ead9c7d62f31b051ed2445.poster.avif?t=1788172062\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/f8bb0e84f1ead9c7d62f31b051ed2445.webm?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/f8bb0e84f1ead9c7d62f31b051ed2445.mp4?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everyone drifts all the time, it's impossible to drive straight!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It doesn't matter if you win by an inch or a mile if you don't do it sideways.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;60% of the time, I'm drifting ALL the time.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible driving physics that are both simple to learn and rewarding to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a variety of vehicles with their own unique characteristics and driving styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your way through scenic courses with multiple layouts and configurations including race tracks, mountain roads, and streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes keep you on your toes by challenging different aspects of your drift racing skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression through challenges unlocks new tracks and cars you can use in multiple modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to challenge the world? Top the leaderboards for each track and mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, against the AI, or show your friends who's the best!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/a08dd9c9e70faa7a3694c6560f3ab6bc.poster.avif?t=1788172062\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/a08dd9c9e70faa7a3694c6560f3ab6bc.webm?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/a08dd9c9e70faa7a3694c6560f3ab6bc.mp4?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle pure arcade drift racing through diverse environments in a great selection of cars across multiple modes. Take yourself back to an era when games respected your time with easy pick-up-and-play ability while retaining a deep progression and challenges to keep you entertained for hours. We know we miss the days when racing games were about the driving feel and experience instead of all the unrelated, scripted spectacles trying to force-feed dopamine down our throats, and that's why we're making Slip Angle.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle is an arcade drift racer that is easy to learn and hard to master, putting you up against a series of challenges to unlock new tracks and cars that can be played across multiple modes. Slip Angle's physics and gameplay were built from scratch with a total focus on fun drift physics that feel amazing and are grounded in realism while still being accessible and unique. Slide your way through multiple variations of stunning tracks, challenging yourself with a diverse set of modes in cars that each have their own characteristics and driving feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/f8bb0e84f1ead9c7d62f31b051ed2445.poster.avif?t=1788172062\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/f8bb0e84f1ead9c7d62f31b051ed2445.webm?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/f8bb0e84f1ead9c7d62f31b051ed2445.mp4?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everyone drifts all the time, it's impossible to drive straight!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It doesn't matter if you win by an inch or a mile if you don't do it sideways.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;60% of the time, I'm drifting ALL the time.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible driving physics that are both simple to learn and rewarding to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a variety of vehicles with their own unique characteristics and driving styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your way through scenic courses with multiple layouts and configurations including race tracks, mountain roads, and streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes keep you on your toes by challenging different aspects of your drift racing skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression through challenges unlocks new tracks and cars you can use in multiple modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to challenge the world? Top the leaderboards for each track and mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, against the AI, or show your friends who's the best!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/a08dd9c9e70faa7a3694c6560f3ab6bc.poster.avif?t=1788172062\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/a08dd9c9e70faa7a3694c6560f3ab6bc.webm?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/a08dd9c9e70faa7a3694c6560f3ab6bc.mp4?t=1788172062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>"